# Verification Contract — {{PROJECT_NAME}}

## Definition of Done

A change is DONE when ALL apply:

### Text checks
- Type check passes: `{{TYPECHECK_CMD}}`
- Lint passes: `{{LINT_CMD}}`
- Tests pass: `{{TEST_CMD}}`

### Runtime checks (when applicable)
- Service starts cleanly (no error logs in first 30s)
- Affected endpoint/CLI/script invokable and returns expected output
- Migrations apply on a clean DB (if schema changed)

### Visual checks (UI changes only)
- Build/render succeeds
- Screenshot captured under `.agent/visual/<feature>.png`
- Markdown evidence note in `.agent/visual/<feature>.md` with: changed files, route, viewport, observed result

### Independent verification
- Test added/updated and exercises the new behavior
- Code reviewed (`/review` or human)
- For security-sensitive paths: `security-reviewer` agent run

## Skip conditions
- Pure docs change: skip runtime + visual
- Test-only change: skip visual
- Refactor (no behavior change): existing tests still pass, no new tests needed
